  "prefLabel": "Rev 2201.08 Federal Accounting Standards Advisory Board (FASAB)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2201.08 “Federal Accounting Standards Advisory Board (FASAB)” means the authoritative standard-setting body responsible for establishing GAAP for the federal government.\n\nSource. #10652, eff 8-8-14; ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
